{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Deep in an abandonned bidirectional research facility, Red sends a distress call. Everybody has died. Device spheres are still active and the sentinels also. You have to find a MindGun. Save Red.</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Rotate</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You interact with core elements by <strong>rotating them</strong>. The MindGun has been designed to handle the specific needs of the complex. Manage threats and devices by mastering this tool. <strong>Shoot, rotate, repulse.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3598550/extras/9aeb8e4b5837d497464b3f598d0260c8.poster.avif?t=1757154103\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3598550/extras/9aeb8e4b5837d497464b3f598d0260c8.webm?t=1757154103\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3598550/extras/9aeb8e4b5837d497464b3f598d0260c8.mp4?t=1757154103\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Survive</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Red thought he was alone: it is not the case anymore. <strong>Sneak is often the best first move</strong> before encountering situations that will be increasingly more difficult.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>The whole area has been abandonned since obscure events: be aware of your surroundings.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3598550/extras/40e5ff6d33dc66585aa09f5a4f676ead.poster.avif?t=1757154103\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3598550/extras/40e5ff6d33dc66585aa09f5a4f676ead.webm?t=1757154103\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3598550/extras/40e5ff6d33dc66585aa09f5a4f676ead.mp4?t=1757154103\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Explore</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >People were about to discover leaks in multiple systems, including the\u00a0<strong>propagation of dissonance</strong>.\u00a0 May the body's recollections say the origins of the malaise.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3598550/extras/75f94a01927072a834cb352fd6488f81.poster.avif?t=1757154103\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3598550/extras/75f94a01927072a834cb352fd6488f81.webm?t=1757154103\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3598550/extras/75f94a01927072a834cb352fd6488f81.mp4?t=1757154103\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Forward backward</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The place is a maze of steel and concrete. Spatial awarness will save you time and effort in both threats encounters and puzzle progress.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>You don't know why you're here and it doesn't matter:</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>what's important is for Red to <strong>remember why</strong> you came.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3598550/extras/01d8a4982a5401b5e3ba68ff8a38fe18.poster.avif?t=1757154103\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_as